OL,3,GNEWSA'I survived anorexia then trekked
OL,4,Athe Great Wall of China'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who battled anorexia for three
OL,7,Fyears in hospital and was told she had
OL,8,Ftwo weeks to live has trekked the Great
OL,9,FWall of China to mark 10 years in
OL,10,Frecovery.
OL,12,FSarah Zurub, from Coventry, said she
OL,13,Fstarted to become unwell at 14 and
OL,14,Fhated her body. "I just wanted to die,"
OL,15,Fshe said.
OL,17,FShe spent her 15th, 16th, and 17th
OL,18,Fbirthdays in hospital and completed her
OL,19,FGCSEs there. She said her outlook on
OL,20,Flife changed after a friend died from
OL,21,Fanorexia.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
