OL,3,GNEWSA'I survived anorexia then trekked
OL,4,Athe Great Wall of China'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It made me think I have to do
OL,7,Fsomething, and it took a long time, but
OL,8,FI made it and I'm proud of how far I've
OL,9,Fcome," she told BBC CWR.
